This is Jiuzhaigou, Sichuan's valley of turquoise lakes.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,600
The water glows blue-green from minerals in the rock.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
In peak season only 41,000 tickets sell each day.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
Over Golden Week they vanish days ahead.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,100
Turn up without one and you're turned away.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Double-tap if you'd book weeks ahead for this.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,200
The colour peaks mid-October to early November.

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,800
★ Expert Tip: skip Oct 1–7; go late Sept or November.

